./README.md:62:### 11. TheTrader Villager
./README.md:63:- The mod checks all villagers every tick for one standing on top of an emerald block
./README.md:64:- A villager named `TheTrader` with a name tag also becomes a TheTrader
./README.md:65:- Matching villagers receive the `TheTrader` tag and, when created with an emerald block, the visible name tag `TheTrader` in bold green text
./README.md:66:- When a villager becomes a TheTrader, conversion sounds and particles play and a message is broadcast in chat
./README.md:67:- A TheTrader picks up nearby dropped items and instantly drops emeralds using these trades:
./README.md:73:- Emeralds are never picked up or consumed by a TheTrader
./README.md:75:- When a TheTrader created with an emerald block is no longer standing on it, its tag and name tag are removed
./README.md:78:### 12. TheDestroyer Villager
./README.md:79:- The mod checks all villagers every tick for one standing on top of a TNT block
./README.md:80:- Matching villagers receive the `TheDestroyer` tag and a floating two-line hologram showing the name and spawn countdown
./README.md:81:- When a villager becomes a TheDestroyer, conversion sounds and particles play and a message is broadcast in chat
./README.md:82:- A TheDestroyer attempts to spawn one creeper every 5 seconds when a valid spawn position exists
./README.md:87:- When a TheDestroyer is no longer standing on a TNT block, its tag, hologram, and creeper-spawning power are removed
./README.md:90:### 13. TheSlimeSummoner Villager
./README.md:91:- The mod checks all villagers every tick for one standing on top of a slime block
