./README.md:95:- Slimes spawn on top of solid blocks, including slime blocks, cobblestone, mud, and hopper blocks
./README.md:99:- When a TheSlimeSummoner is no longer standing on a slime block, its tag, hologram, and slime-summoning power are removed
